    "currentness": "Dispatch and post-final-clock current ledger reads use only retained read roles; unknown effects/held ownership never requeue, refund or release",
    "unchanged": "Original ModelSpec/full vs routing digests, producer/kernel namespaces, original provider/workspace/resource/effect binding and actual Store write authority checks"
